{"product_id":"princess-sophia-and-the-sparkling-surprise-tiara-club-paperback","title":"Princess Sophia and the Sparkling Surprise (Tiara Club (Paperback))","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhere do Princesses go to school? The Princess Academy! There they learn all they need to know about becoming a proper Princess. With dramas and tiaras, this series is full of things for young readers to identify with and enjoy. Each story revolves around the six members of the Tiara Club, Princesses Emily, Katie, Daisy, Charlotte, Sophia and Alice, and follows their adventures as they pass through each level of schooling, from Grade 1 (How to behave at a Grand Ball) to Grade 6 (How to deal with a Wicked Fairy).\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 199\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Vivian French\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781843628620\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 80\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45538588590233,"sku":"9RE-9781843628620","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/686bf3b49a70c-Princess-Sophia-and-the-Sparkling-Surprise-Tiara-Club-Paperback-Vivian-French-_1.jpg?v=1753120974","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/princess-sophia-and-the-sparkling-surprise-tiara-club-paperback","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}